      <VERS vnumber="2"> I will be <gr str="8055">glad </gr>and <gr str="5970">rejoice </gr>in thee: I will sing <gr str="2167">praise </gr>to thy <gr str="8034">name</gr>, O thou most <gr str="5945">High</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="3"> When mine <gr str="341">enemies </gr>are <gr str="7725">turned </gr>
