        <gr str="6664">right</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="5"> Thou hast <gr str="1605">rebuked </gr>the <gr str="1471">heathen</gr>, thou hast <gr str="6">destroyed </gr>the <gr str="7563">wicked</gr>, thou hast put <gr str="4229">out </gr>their <gr str="8034">name </gr>
        <gr str="5769">forever </gr>and <gr str="5703">ever</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6"> O thou <gr str="341">enemy</gr>, <gr str="2723">destructions </gr>are come to a perpetual <gr str="8552 5331">end</gr>: and thou hast <gr str="5428">destroyed </gr>
